s, Garmin GPS units, MP3/MP4 players, Scanner and many more.</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/dtech-usb-30-usb-male-to-male-data-cable-15m\">Dtech USB 3.0 USB Male to Male Data Cable 1.5M</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">600৳</span> \n                                <span class=\"price-old\">650৳</span> \n                                                         \n                        </p>                      \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/ugreen-us102-usb-20-male-to-male-cable-15m-black\">Ugreen US102 USB 2.0 Male to Male Cable 1.5M (Black) </a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                        